@ October 28, 2026

The OPNsense business edition transitions to this 26.10 release including
interface management and gateway groups via MVC/API, wireless MVC/API support,
firewall rules now defaulting to MVC/API, customizable favorites menu, full
screen grids, the OPNDNS plugin as a authoritative nameserver with RFC2136
support, FreeBSD 15.1, OpenSSL 3.5, PHP 8.5 plus much more.

Please make sure to read the migration notes before upgrading.

Download link is as follows.  An installation guide[1] and the checksums for
the images can be found below as well.

https://downloads.opnsense.com/

This business release is based on the OPNsense 26.7.7 community version
with additional reliability improvements.

Here are the full patch notes:

